# Benefits of MITRE ATT&CK

Using MITRE ATT&CK provides:

* Common terminology
* Standardized reporting
* Better threat analysis
* Improved detection engineering
* Easier communication between teams

---

# Conclusion

Mapping simulated attacks to MITRE ATT&CK techniques improved understanding of attacker behavior and demonstrated how security teams categorize, investigate, and respond to suspicious activities using industry-recognized frameworks.
